  "description": "A stylized monotile-inspired hat pattern with animated edge glow, paired with a raymarched geometric relief sculpture. Each hat shows its kite seams, metatile cells share a substitution tint, and a fainter second-generation supertile outline marks the next inflation. It is an artistic motif rather than a proof-accurate hat tiling.",
